   | BI Bulletin install            RENDIR Rename file dir      | 
   | BC Bulletin clear              DELCONF Delete conference   | 
   | IF Install file area           RENCONF Rename conference   | 
   | FI File install                RESCONF Reset conference    | 
   | MEM Show available memory      MOVE file                   | 
   | INVite user to conference      RENFILE Rename file         | 
